  "note": "The town's quests. type: main (violet) or side (yellow). Objective types so far: talk (talk to `npc`) and chooseClass. autoStart quests start the first time a player is in town (and for anyone who hasn't done them yet). dialogue: lines the giver says instead of their usual ones while the quest is on: talk (in order, while talking is the current objective), remind (talking again before the next objective is done), complete (when the quest is done; {class} is the class's name). rewards: items given into the combat bag when it's completed ({ item: an items.json or equipment.json id, count }); a quest finished before it had rewards gives them on the next visit. Every quest up to Lv 20 gives Low HP and MP Potions. leveling: one of the Tanod's leveling chain (objective types kill and miniBoss, reported over his radio): its title, goal, count, XP and Kusing rewards and his give/report lines come from classes/leveling.json by its id; the entry keeps its type, giver, item rewards and next.",
